  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e83606f83acda824eb8bebc48e19bab3, type: 3}
  m_Name: StanPhrases
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StalkerPhraseBook
  spotted:
  - there you are.
  - i see you.
  - found you.
  - hello again.
  - peekaboo.
  - don't run. please run.
  - you look tired.
  - i was waiting.
  lit:
  - too bright.
  - you can't keep it on forever.
  - click. click.
  - blink.
  - i'll wait.
  - your battery is dying.
  - statue game?
  - don't look away.
  staring:
  - stay still.
  - "one\u2026 two\u2026"
  - shhh.
  - let me look at you.
  - closer.
  - don't move.
  lunge:
  - BOO.
  - TAG!
  - "GOT YOU\u2014"
  - MINE.
  - NOW.
  touch:
  - tag. you're it.
  - warm.
  - he heard that.
  - i told him where you are.
  - your light tastes good.
  lost:
  - where did you go?
  - hide and seek, then.
  - i can hear you breathing.
  - you'll come back.
  - "ready or not\u2026"
  locker:
  - knock knock.
  - i know which one.
  - it's cramped in there, isn't it?
  - come out, come out.
  - i can wait all night.
  idle:
  - do you like the maze?
  - he's closer than me.
  - floor {floor}. not many left.
  - your heart is loud.
  - the stars aren't for you.
  - keep walking.
